<title>POLAND: PBR MAY NET FALLS TO PLN 1.6 MLN.</title>
<headline>PBR MAY NET FALLS TO PLN 1.6 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results May</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MAY						  1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					  1.58 vs    2.19</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    2.61 vs    3.72</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  8.29 vs    5.30</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	18.69 vs   17.99</p>
<p> JANUARY-MAY					 1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					 11.27 vs   13.43</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   19.46 vs   23.21</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 43.89 vs   40.52</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	91.15 vs   85.63</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Polski Bank Rozwoju SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
